# The rows of src/baseclasses/Pipelines.h and src/baseclasses/Pipelines.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Pipelines.cpp/Drawn, with depth
drawn, depth dropped -> a framebuffer true, the old one's false; kept depth none
drawn, depth kept -> a framebuffer true, the old one's false; kept depth slot 2, 64x32
drawn, depth none -> a framebuffer true, the old one's false; kept depth none
render pass, depth dropped -> #1; asked again, the same: true
render pass, depth kept -> #1; asked again, the same: true
render pass, depth none -> #1; asked again, the same: true
the device goes -> done

## Pipelines.cpp/PassBlock
PassBlock of 0 bytes -> throws runtime_error: "vmaCreateBuffer failed: VkResult -3"
PassBlock of 1048576 bytes -> set #1, 1048576 bytes mapped; printed "VUID-VkWriteDescriptorSet-descriptorType-00332(ERROR / SPEC): ms... 9, name: NULL\n" (980 characters, hash 14870ddfe404284a)
PassBlock of 16 bytes -> set #1, 16 bytes mapped
PassBlock of 16384 bytes -> set #1, 16384 bytes mapped
PassBlock of 256 bytes -> set #1, 256 bytes mapped
PassBlock of 4 bytes -> set #1, 4 bytes mapped
PassBlock of 65536 bytes -> set #1, 65536 bytes mapped
PassBlock of 65537 bytes -> set #1, 65537 bytes mapped; printed "VUID-VkWriteDescriptorSet-descriptorType-00332(ERROR / SPEC): ms... 9, name: NULL\n" (976 characters, hash 4a49fd5250fe238a)
the device goes -> done
this GPU's maxUniformBufferRange -> 65536

