## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::frame_slots
2 asked -> room for 3, slot 0 (0,0), slot 1 (0,0), slot 2 (0,0)
3 asked -> room for 3, slot 0 (0,0), slot 1 (0,0), slot 2 (0,0)
declared -> room for 1, slot 0 (0,0)
no block declared, 3 asked -> no frame block
the device goes -> done
written, then 3 asked again -> room for 3, slot 0 (100,50), slot 1 (10,20), slot 2 (30,40)

## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::pool
1,000 more -> pools [1024,1]
1,000 of them gone -> pools [24,1]
1,025 blocks -> pools [1024,1]
all gone -> pools [0,0]
the device goes -> done

## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::render_pass
(B8G8R8A8_SRGB) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(BC1_RGB_UNORM_BLOCK) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"; printed "VUID-VkSubpassDescription-pColorAttachments-02648(ERROR / SPEC):...    Objects: 0\n" (949 characters, hash 03b9ac818b04ae1d)
(D32_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"; printed "VUID-VkSubpassDescription-pColorAttachments-02648(ERROR / SPEC):...    Objects: 0\n" (1081 characters, hash 24c13998cb92d26d)
(R16G16B16A16_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R16G16_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R16_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R32G32B32A32_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R32G32_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R32_SFLOAT) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R8G8B8A8_SRGB) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R8G8B8A8_UNORM) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R8G8_UNORM) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(R8_UNORM) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"
(UNDEFINED) -> "#1; asked again, the same: true"; printed "VUID-VkAttachmentDescription-format-06698(ERROR / SPEC): msgNum:...    Objects: 0\n" (454 characters, hash 5cb0c55790e747e3)
the device goes -> done

## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::render_pass, no depth format
depth dropped -> throws runtime_error: "this GPU tests depth in none of D32_SFLOAT, X8_D24_UNORM_PACK32 and D16_UNORM"
depth kept -> throws runtime_error: "this GPU tests depth in none of D32_SFLOAT, X8_D24_UNORM_PACK32 and D16_UNORM"
depth none -> made
the device goes -> done

## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::take_frame, a block declared otherwise
the device goes -> done
time a uint -> throws runtime_error: "its frame block is not the one the engine writes: uvec2 resolution, vec2 cursor, float time and uint index, as baseclasses/GpuLayout.glsl declares them (RV02)"
time as declared -> made
time named tame -> throws runtime_error: "its frame block is not the one the engine writes: uvec2 resolution, vec2 cursor, float time and uint index, as baseclasses/GpuLayout.glsl declares them (RV02)"

## Pipelines.cpp/Pipelines::take_slot
all gone -> 1022 free
free slots then -> 0
slot 2 freed, the next takes 2
taken until refused: 1022 more held, then throws runtime_error: "textures[] holds 1023 images, all taken"
the device goes -> done
the first three take slots 1, 2, 3

